{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/0f63828ae7a7b40e6b40dab697eb22da.avif?t=1769324698\" width=400 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/823dba116cc3f13cff4f50f8b75317ea.avif?t=1769324698\" width=400 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, run and run till the Devil catches you! Well, good news! You do the jumping, and we do the running for you. You can jump to avoid enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/410d8ddc895ae1bf6fe9443bcbc01bb2.poster.avif?t=1769324698\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/410d8ddc895ae1bf6fe9443bcbc01bb2.webm?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/410d8ddc895ae1bf6fe9443bcbc01bb2.mp4?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/a2e37af4fc9afda0e7c7a8716f6e28b9.avif?t=1769324698\" width=400 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot up those enemies in your face! It feels like blasting a ball of gum. Shooting is part of the process. Well, the Devil doesn't care, and he'll just spawn more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/4d544a8d981a9ae11bab8e2793543e07.poster.avif?t=1769324698\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/4d544a8d981a9ae11bab8e2793543e07.webm?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/4d544a8d981a9ae11bab8e2793543e07.mp4?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/4c9709ec18cba4ab7df023c278dc1643.avif?t=1769324698\" width=400 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the three items that the Three Sleeping Imps require! Bring it to them, exchange them for Sleeping Orbs and complete the Ritual! There are 3 of them. You can do it to beat the game!\u00a0That is, if you survive. As usual, they are a bit taller than you are (no offense) so jump to gain those sweet, sweet powerups!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/2cff00c5ecaf421b3b92e3fa0cae5d61.poster.avif?t=1769324698\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/2cff00c5ecaf421b3b92e3fa0cae5d61.webm?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128880/extras/2cff00c5ecaf421b3b92e3fa0cae5d61.mp4?t=1769324698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128880?t=1769324698","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as